INSERT INTO `ppm_checklist` VALUES (1277, 1, 'uitmmukah - Cold Water Tank', 'C002A', '1.1', 'Preventive Maintenance Checklist for Cold Water Tank site UiTM Mukah (M)', 'The following guidelines shall be followed:\n1.	Use proper and suitable personal protective equipment.\n2.	Ensure the technicians are aware of the hazards/ aspect and well-trained job.', 248, 233755, '00:15:00', '00:30:00', 0, '2022-01-29 11:19:52', '2022-01-26 14:30:48', 926, 1);
